    @subsection geos_1_0 geos Module Version 1.0

    <b>New Features and Bug Fixes</b>
    - Initial release
    - Classes: GEOSGeometry, GEOSPreparedGeometry, GEOSSTRtree, GEOSWKTReader,
      GEOSWKTWriter, GEOSWKBReader, GEOSWKBWriter
    - Standalone functions: geos_version(), get_geos_info(), parse_wkt(), make_wkt(),
      parse_wkb(), make_wkb()
    - Hashdecls: GEOSCoordinate, GEOSVersionInfo
    - Thread-safe implementation using reentrant GEOS C API
    - Cooperative cancellation support in STRtree queries
    - @ref geosdataproviderintro "GEOSDataProvider" separated module with WKT and WKB data providers
      for use in data pipelines
*/
